<title>NETHERLANDS: POLL - DUTCH COMPANY RESULTS WEEK OF AUG 18.</title>
<headline>POLL - DUTCH COMPANY RESULTS WEEK OF AUG 18.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of</p>
<p>Dutch company results for the week of Aug 18-22:</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY-----PERIOD--PROFIT-------CONSENSUS---RANGE-----PVS</p>
<p>19/8  Ahrend	H1 97   net ord ops     28	27/30	24</p>
<p>20/8  Nedlloyd    Q2 97   net ord ops	5     -14/+20     21</p>
<p>20/8  Nedlloyd    H1 97   net ord ops    -39     -50/-25	6</p>
<p>20/8  Pakhoed     H1 97   net ord ops     97	88/103     59</p>
<p>20/8  Wegener     H1 97   net ord ops     37	35/41	31</p>
<p>21/8  ASR	   H1 97   net ord ops     76	74/78	62</p>
<p>21/8  ABN AMRO    H1 97   net ord ops    2100   1994/2243  1696</p>
<p>21/8  ABN AMRO    H1 97   net attrib     2000   1908/2151  1602</p>
<p>21/8  Int Mueller H1 97   net ord ops     51	49/54	45</p>
<p>21/8  Nutricia    H1 97   net ord ops    135     126/159    107</p>
<p>21/8  Ten Cate    H1 97   net ord ops     21	19/22	17</p>
<p>21/8  Boskalis    H1 97   net ord ops     33	29/38	27</p>
<p>22/8  Aegon	 Q2 97   net ord ops    445     402/471    385</p>
<p>22/8  Aegon	 H1 97   net ord ops    865     837/885    711</p>
<p>NOTES - Profit figures exclude extraordinary items and are</p>
<p>in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. They are stated</p>
<p>before deduction of preference dividends where applicable.</p>
<p>Outlying estimates are sometimes excluded if they fall far</p>
<p>outside the range of most forecasts.</p>
<p>* ABN AMRO estimates are for overall net profit and</p>
<p>for net profit attributable to ordinary shareholders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
